Using the same team/year from the prior step, extend the report to also pull the team’s total wins and losses from TEAM. Then decide if the season was a "SUCCESS" (wins > losses) or "STRUGGLE" (otherwise). Print a single summary line. Make sure it handles missing TEAM data or multiple TEAM rows cleanly.

Requirements:
Procedure Name: Anonymous Block
Parameters: None
Output: DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Season summary: ' || lv_team_id || '/' || lv_year || ' avg_att=' || TO_CHAR(ROUND(lv_avg_att, 2)) || ' W-L=' || lv_w || '-' || lv_l || ' => ' || lv_season_label);
