question:
Tie it all together: for a given channel id, print a compact channel overview with (a) channel description, (b) total amount sold across all time, and (c) a simple recommendation string: "PRIORITY" if total amount sold is above a caller-provided threshold, otherwise "NORMAL". Handle missing channel ids cleanly.

Requirements:
Procedure Name: Anonymous Block.
Parameters:
p_channel_id IN COMPLEX_ORACLE.CHANNELS.channel_id%TYPE.
p_priority_amount IN COMPLEX_ORACLE.SALES.amount_sold%TYPE.
Output:
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Channel id is required.');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Priority amount is required.');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Channel overview: ' || p_channel_id || ' - ' || lv_channel_desc);
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Total amount sold: ' || lv_total_amount);
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Recommendation: ' || lv_reco);
Exception Handling:
WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN: 'No data found.'
WHEN TOO_MANY_ROWS THEN: 'Multiple rows returned.'
WHEN OTHERS THEN: 'Unexpected error.'

reference_answer:
DECLARE
  p_channel_id       COMPLEX_ORACLE.CHANNELS.channel_id%TYPE := NULL;
  p_priority_amount  COMPLEX_ORACLE.SALES.amount_sold%TYPE := NULL;

  lv_channel_desc    COMPLEX_ORACLE.CHANNELS.channel_desc%TYPE;
  lv_total_amount    COMPLEX_ORACLE.SALES.amount_sold%TYPE;
  lv_reco            VARCHAR2(20);
BEGIN
  IF p_channel_id IS NULL THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Channel id is required.');
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  IF p_priority_amount IS NULL THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Priority amount is required.');
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  SELECT c.channel_desc
    INTO lv_channel_desc
    FROM COMPLEX_ORACLE.CHANNELS c
   WHERE c.channel_id = p_channel_id;

  SELECT SUM(s.amount_sold)
    INTO lv_total_amount
    FROM COMPLEX_ORACLE.SALES s
   WHERE s.channel_id = p_channel_id;

  IF lv_total_amount > p_priority_amount THEN
    lv_reco := 'PRIORITY';
  ELSE
    lv_reco := 'NORMAL';
  END IF;

  DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Channel overview: ' || p_channel_id || ' - ' || lv_channel_desc);
  DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Total amount sold: ' || lv_total_amount);
  DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Recommendation: ' || lv_reco);

EXCEPTION
  WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('No data found.');
  WHEN TOO_MANY_ROWS THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Multiple rows returned.');
  WHEN OTHERS THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Unexpected error.');
END;
