question:
Now make the same report reusable for operations. Create a stored procedure that takes (1) a year and (2) a minimum total fertility rate threshold. The procedure should print only countries in that year whose total fertility rate is numeric and at least the threshold, still limited to 15 rows, ordered by highest rate first. Add a simple control-flow message when the threshold is NULL (treat it as 0).

Requirements:
Procedure Name: report_high_fertility
Parameters:
p_year IN CENSUS_BUREAU_INTERNATIONAL.AGE_SPECIFIC_FERTILITY_RATES.year%TYPE
