question:
We need a quick scouting report for a specific season. Build an anonymous PL/SQL block that lists up to 15 player-seasons with the most plate appearances (AB) for a given year, showing the player_id and total AB across all stints/teams that year. Use an explicit cursor (manual OPEN/FETCH/CLOSE) so we can later reuse the same iteration pattern for downstream processing. Add basic guardrails so that if the year is null or if no batting rows exist for that year, the script prints a clear message instead of failing.

Requirements:
Procedure Name: Anonymous Block
Parameters: None
Output:
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Top AB report for year=' || lv_year);
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('PLAYER_ID=' || lv_player_id || ' TOTAL_AB=' || lv_total_ab);
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('No batting rows found for year.');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Year is required.');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('No data found.');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Multiple rows returned.');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Unexpected error.');
Exception Handling:
WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN: 'No data found.'
WHEN TOO_MANY_ROWS THEN: 'Multiple rows returned.'
WHEN OTHERS THEN: 'Unexpected error.'

reference_answer:
DECLARE
  lv_year BASEBALL.BATTING.year%TYPE := 1998;
  co_report_limit CONSTANT PLS_INTEGER := 15; -- Limit output for report readability

  CURSOR c_top_ab(p_year BASEBALL.BATTING.year%TYPE) IS
    SELECT b.player_id,
           SUM(b.ab) AS total_ab
      FROM BASEBALL.BATTING b
     WHERE b.year = p_year
     GROUP BY b.player_id
     ORDER BY SUM(b.ab) DESC, b.player_id;

  lv_player_id BASEBALL.BATTING.player_id%TYPE;
  lv_total_ab  BASEBALL.BATTING.ab%TYPE;
  lv_rows      PLS_INTEGER := 0;
BEGIN
  IF lv_year IS NULL THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Year is required.');
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Top AB report for year=' || lv_year);

  OPEN c_top_ab(lv_year);
  LOOP
    FETCH c_top_ab INTO lv_player_id, lv_total_ab;
    EXIT WHEN c_top_ab%NOTFOUND OR lv_rows >= co_report_limit;

    lv_rows := lv_rows + 1;
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('PLAYER_ID=' || lv_player_id || ' TOTAL_AB=' || lv_total_ab);
  END LOOP;
  CLOSE c_top_ab;

  IF lv_rows = 0 THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('No batting rows found for year.');
  END IF;

EXCEPTION
  WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('No data found.');
  WHEN TOO_MANY_ROWS THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Multiple rows returned.');
  WHEN OTHERS THEN
    DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Unexpected error.');
END;
/

