Requirements:
Procedure Name: Anonymous Block.
Parameters: None.
Output: DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Hospitals in state = ' || lv_state || ' missing inpatient charge rows (max rows = ' || co_report_limit || ')');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Missing inpatient charges for provider_id = ' || r.provider_id || ' (' || r.hospital_name || ')');
DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('No missing inpatient charge providers found for state = ' || lv_state || '.');
Exception Handling: WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN: 'No data found.'
